ty with catnip-fuelled zoomies! \n\nPlus, the official EXPLODING KITTENS® 2 game brings the most-requested mechanic of all…the Nope card! Stuff a glorious Nope Sandwich right into the horrified faces of your friends – with extra Nopesauce, of course. \n\n\nHOW TO PLAY EXPLODING KITTENS® 2 \n1. Download the EXPLODING KITTENS® 2 online game. \n2. Optional: Get your friends to download it too. \n3. Each player plays as many cards as they like on their turn OR passes!\n4. The player then draws a card to end their turn. If it’s an EXPLODING KITTEN, they’re out (unless they have a handy Defuse card). \n5. Keep going until only one player is left standing! \n\n\nFEATURES\n- CUSTOMISE YOUR AVATARS – Dress your avatar up in the season’s hottest outfits (cat hair not included)\n- REACT TO GAMEPLAY – Personalise your emoji sets to ensure your trash talk has a razor-sharp edge.\n- MULTIPLE GAME MODES – Play alone against our expert AI or impress your mum with your sparkling social life by playing with friends online! \n- ANIMATED CARDS – The mayhem comes to life with awesome animations! Those Nope cards just hit different now…\n\nSteady yourself, think of calming waves and draw a card!", "trackCensoredName": "Exploding Kittens® 2", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/exploding-kittens-2/id6478287619?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "9+", "averageUserRating": 5, "minimumOsVersion": "15.0", "bundleId": "com.marmalade.explodingkittens", "trackId": 6478287619, "trackName": "Exploding Kittens® 2", "genres": ["게임", "보드", "카드", "엔터테인먼트"], "artistId": 988365603, "artistName": "Marmalade Game Studio", "userRatingCount": 5}]}